ecks passed.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>"), "parents": Array [String("6d19332793c0819f5219a4ed42fcc8f0d7f813a4")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("2c8f8ddd0"), "subject": String("fix(rust-tauri): complete notes and memory events; isolate W11 FIFO reader")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("lingxi-dev"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1791975412), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("6d19332793c0819f5219a4ed42fcc8f0d7f813a4"), "message": String("fix(rust-tauri): f12 child-output echo no longer trips the single-test settlement check; ledger records first real verify-stage R06 run (FAIL, R06 not accepted)\n\n- quote child process output line-by-line in the two f12 tests that echo it\n- AR_PROGRESS stage_gate / AR_HANDOFF: 371/376 bindings PASS, 5 FAIL (2 fixed, 3 w11 one-off not reproduced),\n  gate structurally blocked by 78 required_behavior_pending leaves; no R06_ACCEPTED / R07_READY claim\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>"), "parents": Array [String("156d46623cc2ab35eb5cf8587090c5cf5fd42cea")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("6d1933279"), "subject": String("fix(rust-tauri): f12 child-output echo no longer trips the single-test settlement check; ledger records first real verify-stage R06 run (FAIL, R06 not accepted)")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("lingxi-dev"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1791962766), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("156d46623cc2ab35eb5cf8587090c5cf5fd42cea"), "message": String("fix(rust-tauri): rename R06 inputs-check command key to avoid case-insensitive evidence-dir collision (r06_inputs vs R06_INPUTS on APFS)\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>"), "parents": Array [String("bd0333e2d5b836aca4b330ce8a0521280019fc1e")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("156d46623"), "subject": String("fix(rust-tauri): rename R06 inputs-