igned to incumbent whole-order semantics\n- F14 pending formal gate; F15 pending evaluator round\n\nIntegration fixes (master):\n- wal_checkpoint bounded grace (checkpoint_grace_ms), home-uniqueness race in\n  5 suites, knowledge claim ordering, F12 schema-newer classification order,\n  F14 registry v12/v13, t04 trusted-history decode symmetry (missing binding =\n  host-driven turns), r04_t02 admission pre-registration contract in tests,\n  admission dedup family (6 suites) forwarding fixes, AR-F08 timing redesign\n  (cancel_link quota-wait settlement), tool_result_model_projection event in\n  cancellation_tree expectations\n\nVerification: full lingxi-service 515/1 (r00_management env-limited: LAN\ninterface blocked by firewall/TUN, surfaced honestly by the test), kernel\n187/0, adapters 433/0; clippy -D warnings and fmt clean; contract tests\n20/20; binding executions batches 1-6 all PASS in fresh windows.\n\nRegistration: leaf bindings 192 READY / 87 GAP (GUI/host-channel remainder\ncategorized, host-attribution list produced for review adjudication); anchor\nrefreshes for the format pass and deliberate semantic changes documented.\n\nThis is the freeze candidate for independent review and the formal stage\ngate; R06_NOT_ACCEPTED until reviews and verify-stage R06 pass."), "parents": Array [String("6f5c4b01d6805ac95fa03a35c2035ccb35f7b8f8")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("844a10b2b"), "subject": String("fix(rust-tauri): R06 closeout candidate — backend gap closure, AR replays, integration fixes")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("lingxi-dev"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1791807710), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("6f5c4b01d6805ac95fa03a35c2035ccb35f7b8f8"), "message": String("chore(rust-tauri): R06 AR repair working-tree checkpoint (bulk commit)\n\nCommit the full pending R06 AR working tree per user instruction:\n\n- W01–W15 repair products across lingxi-adapters / lingxi-kernel /\n  lingxi-service (storage splits: agent_config, session_operations,\n  subagent_threads; embedding_operation, file_safety, model_history,\n  stagefiles, toolcatalog_bridge)\n- r06_ar_* repair tests and r06_original_*_proofs original-scope suites\n- knowledge cache-preservation fixes (lib/knowledge ANN / fulltext /\n  vector backends + TS preservation tests)\n- Tauri shell scaffolding (desktop/src-tauri, tauri-resources,\n  vite.tauri-resources.config.ts)\n- repair-current AR docs, R06 stage ledger updates, evidence artifacts\n- .gitignore: rust/target*/ wildcard for per-task CARGO_TARGET_DIR\n- remove tracked dist-sandbox/mac-* strict sandbox binaries\n\nNot an acceptance claim: AR_PROGRESS remains R06_NOT_ACCEPTED\n(closed_count=1, open_count=14). Local .vscode/ left uncommitted."), "parents": Array [String("bc2ce51fd005ea75b9949156974e15d2761eb734")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("6f5c4b01d"), "subject": String("chore(rust-tauri): R06 AR repair working-tree checkpoint (bulk commit)")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("lingxi-dev"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1791703684), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("bc2ce51fd005ea75b9949156974e15d2761eb734"), "message": String("fix(rust-tauri): R06-AR-F08 preserve tool-result cap on warnings"), "parents": Array [String("2e1933d8f16d0f383b85ca92ff5bdf29e4732e6d")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("bc2ce51fd"), "subject": String("fix(rust-tauri): R06-AR-F08 preserve tool-result cap on warnings")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("lingxi-dev"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1791692065), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("2e1933d8f16d0f383b85ca92ff5bdf29e4732e6d"), "message": String("chore(rust-tauri): R06 stage status ACCEPTED (36d2efb5a pushed, remote confirmed)"), "parents": Array [String("36d2efb5a672be42e4b017c5d4a93fe99b1011bf")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("2e1933d8f"), "subject": String("chore(rust-tauri): R06 stage status 