ep10\n\n来源：LingxiAgent-contract-hardening 工作区提交 d011e849（基线 e0afc0dc）。\n与 1d42b740（历史分页×Run 连续性 + 轨迹复用双身份）及 787437d3（历史读取\n三阶段优化）的重叠文件按语义并存合并：\n\n- server/routes/sessions.ts：契约批在文件尾部的 7 个辅助函数为死代码（历史\n  读取批已将其迁往 server/history-read/ 且本文件不再调用），整块移除。\n- 契约批两处语义移植到新位置：历史块生命周期补丁不再回填 version/size/\n  mtimeMs（server/history-read/hydrate.ts）；isMediaGenerationDeferredResult\n  纳入 speech-generation（server/history-read/projection-context.ts）。\n- core/engine.ts、core/session-coordinator.ts、export-manifest.json 自动合并，\n  契约批的 engine dispose await 修复保留。\n- build/cli-runtime-closure.json、build/open-boundary-baseline.json、\n  build/persistence-schema-fingerprint.json 按合并后树形重新生成\n  （fingerprint --classification compatible：两批均已各自声明 compatible，\n  无新持久化形状变化）。\n\n合并后验证：tsc×3 全过；定向 20 文件 449/449；全量 13,820 过 / 5 失败 /\n7 跳过——5 个失败（round2×2、round3×1、audit-seal、packaged-desktop-cleanup）\n全部为封印坐标类治理事项与预存红，与基线签名一致，合并引入 0 新失败\n（基线另 2 个 ObservabilityDateLine 失败在合并后转绿）。原生\nswift run lingxi-speech-core-tests 22/22。"), "parents": Array [String("787437d3743a6937f59d817cae08d93debea458d"), String("d011e8497428c2a85fb20208ef70fa53d56e86d5")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("433492c5f"), "subject": String("merge: 架构契约补强七领域并入 fix/pending-sep10")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("lingxi-dev"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1789084390), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("787437d3743a6937f59d817cae08d93debea458d"), "message": String("feat: 历史读取三阶段优化——目录快路径/追加增量续读/条件请求与概览协议\n\n- B：普通分页 /sessions/messages 走 server/history-read 目录快路径（目录缓存\n  +定点读取+同源投影）。\n- C：可信追加增量续读为读取主路径（目录 revision/增量，开放 Run 无 O(Run)）。\n- E：条件请求（ETag/If-None-Match）+ 概览聚合路由 + 客户端协议层\n  （history-protocol-client/history-overview-client/HistoryOverviewBadge）\n  接线生产路径；调页实验定案 K=100，能力协商保守校验。\n- 持久化指纹 compatible repin，guard/tripwire 全绿。\n\n验收：56 项中 55 已修复并验证、1 项（Y14 真实浏览器跨源 CORS）已实现但\n指定环境未验证；全量回归 13,735 过 / 7 失败与 HEAD 基线签名逐条一致\n（任务引入 0）。证据：artifacts/history-read-directory/（F06 总报告、\nacceptance-matrix.json、known-failures-comparison.json）。\n再生的 r01-r10 source.patch 按任务口径还原，不计入本提交。"), "parents": Array [String("1d42b7405c76292f617291e3a01cd2f3ef5efd04")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("787437d37"), "subject": String("feat: 历史读取三阶段优化——目录快路径/追加增量续读/条件请求与概览协议")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("lingxi-dev"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1789084117), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("d011e8497428c2a85fb20208ef70fa53d56e86d5"), "message": String("feat: 架构契约补强七领域——输入接受边界/迁移收据 v4/媒体任务代次/语音 superseded/MCP 代次\n\n- 输入接受与取消：分开记录尚未移交/已移交待证/已观察写入；准备期取消发\n  input_cancelled_before_acceptance；插入接口改为等待异步结果的 Promise<boolean>；\n  移交后 session_busy 不再触发跨会话重发。\n- 记忆迁移与恢复：v4 收据（prepared→committing→target_committed→sources_archived\n  →completed），committing 先于目标写盘；仅 v4 prepared 可重放，中断窗口保守转冲突。\n- 媒体任务：TaskStore 损坏即报错不覆盖、destroy=requireFlush；settleTask/\n  beginAttempt 尝试编号；poller 代次重写，durable 交接回执。\n- 语音：ASR 尝试所有权 superseded 语义；PCM 以 .pcm 交付；原生协调器保存提前\n  到达的终局并恰好结算一次。\n- MCP：客户端实例即连接代次；operation ownership 测试覆盖。\n- 文件块提取共用转换 server/session-file-block.ts（已入 export-manifest）。\n\n验证：vitest 全量 13,609 过 / 4 基线预存红 / 7 跳过；tsc×3 + eslint 0 error；\n原生 swift run lingxi-speech-core-tests 22/22。证据见\nartifacts/architecture-contract-hardening/（REPORT.md 与先红后绿日志）。"), "parents": Array [String("e0afc0dc3b94bc9763d715f981d6f948d1c39c27")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("d011e8497"), "subject": String("feat: 架构契约补强七领域——输入接受边界/迁移收据 v4/媒体任务代次/语音 superseded/MCP 代次")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("lingxi-dev"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1789006106), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("1d42b7405c76292f617291e3a01cd2f3ef5efd04"), "message": String("fix: 历史分页 Run 连续性 + 轨迹复用双身份两案修复\n\n历史分页×Run 连续性：归并显示 id 不再误当分页游标（92 页失控收敛为 3 页），\n页片段终态统一由 projector/resolver 双裁决，补 runFacts 缝合与末条终态不变量。\n\n模型观测轨迹复用双身份：复用查找改用 manifest 业务会话 ID（原误用 SDK 文件头\nUUID，自 09-05 上线起未工作过，v6 迁移掩盖），v7 幂等合并修复，双身份测试防假阳性。"), "parents": Array [String("e0afc0dc3b94bc9763d715f981d6f948d1c39c27")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("1d42b7405"), "subject": String("fix: 历史分页 Run 连续性 + 轨迹复用双身份两案修复")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("lingxi-dev"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1788965987), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("e0afc0dc3b94bc9763d715f981d6f948d1c39c27"), "message": String("chore: v0.1.37 发布结果审计收口\n\n运行 34364163117 全绿：v0.1.37 正式发布 Latest（18 产物），\ntrain-stable-16 / train-beta-19 双列车发布；AtomGit 镜像失败为既有\n长期故障（best-effort）。"), "parents": Array [String("4ae02c834383d0d977ae7b7d238eecf0d0c864e5")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("e0afc0dc3"), "subject": String("chore: v0.1.37 发布结果审计收口")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("lingxi-dev"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1788964274), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("4ae02c834383d0d977ae7b7d238eecf0d0c864e5"), "message": String("chore: 封印 v0.1.37 预检断言推进候选\n\nVERIFIED_SOURCE_SHA 推进至 696016b7（release-preflight 当前产品 tag\n断言随版本推进到 v0.1.37）。六处坐标一致更新。"), "parents": Array [String("696016b7d609b8967db095fa88912119e89b7215")], "refs": Array [Object {"kind": String("tag"), "name": String("v0.1.37")}, Object {"kind": String("tag"), "name": String("train-stable-16")}], "shortHash": String("4ae02c834"), "subject": String("chore: 封印 v0.1.37 预检断言推进候选")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("lingxi-dev"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1788964248), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("696016b7d609b8967db095fa88912119e89b7215"), "message": String("test: release-preflight 当前产品 tag 断言随版本推进到 v0.1.37\n\nef7656c5 升版时漏更该硬编码断言（v0.1.36 时代值），本地冒烟在升版前\n跑过未复跑，CI 第三轮 tag 运行的 artifact-release-smoke 岗哨拦截。\n现断言 v0.1.37 / 世代 15 / 历史最大 0.1.36 / 14；升版后本机\ntest:artifact-release-smoke 305/305 复跑全绿。"), "parents": Array [String("b022aceeff1b70f16a2bbfd58fa88a6664789e4e")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("696016b7d"), "subject": String("test: release-preflight 当前产品 tag 断言随版本推进到 v0.1.37")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("lingxi-dev"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1788962524), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("b022aceeff1b70f16a2bbfd58fa88a6664789e4e"), "message": String("chore: 封印 v0.1.37 冒烟加固候选\n\nVERIFIED_SOURCE_SHA 推进至 acde46f1（smoke-packaged-desktop 慢跑者/\nWindows 清理竞态加固）。两次 tag 运行失败定性为环境抖动非产品回归，\n证据与加固理由见 PROGRESS.md v0.1.37 条目补记。六处坐标一致更新。"), "parents": Array [String("acde46f1a734b27fac3b7ef0dcb6bd7d34634aac")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("b022aceef"), "subject": String("chore: 封印 v0.1.37 冒烟加固候选")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("lingxi-dev"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1788962496), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("acde46f1a734b27fac3b7ef0dcb6bd7d34634aac"), "message": String("test: 打包桌面冒烟抗慢跑者与 Windows 清理竞态加固（v0.1.37 两次 tag 运行实锤）\n\n两次 v0.1.37 tag 运行均败在 smoke-packaged-desktop，且均非产品回归：\n- 运行一：慢跑者顶满 90s 就绪期限（同作业打包知识冒烟 87s，健康范围\n  60–71s；服务端仍停在导入入口，健康跑者实测就绪 64–70s）\n- 运行二：桌面 69.4s 全就绪（onboarding 正常、serverReady=true），败于\n  收尾 rmSync EPERM——taskkill 后 Windows 句柄异步释放，原 10×100ms\n  重试窗口不足\n\n加固（沿用向量关闭预算类既有 flaky 处理先例）：就绪期限 90s→150s，\n真故障（服务端从不就绪）仍判败；清理重试升至 40×500ms，清理失败不\n推翻已定型的就绪判定，但 cleanupPassed/cleanupError 如实入库（不静默）。\n同作业同服务器包的知识冒烟两轮均通过，佐证非包体问题。"), "parents": Array [String("1866da1967fefdb862c419c7600bfbbab6429e53")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("acde46f1a"), "subject": String("test: 打包桌面冒烟抗慢跑者与 Windows 清理竞态加固（v0.1.37 两次 tag 运行实锤）")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("lingxi-dev"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1788959467), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("1866da1967fefdb862c419c7600bfbbab6429e53"), "message": String("chore: 封印 v0.1.37 发布候选\n\nVERIFIED_SOURCE_SHA 推进至发布元数据提交 ef7656c5（源码候选 c9494ae9 +\n版本/digest 元数据）。验证：typecheck×3 绿 + eslint 0 error（最终树）；\n全量 13530 passed / 0 failed / 7 skipped；artifact-release-smoke 305/305；\nrelease:preflight PASS。六处坐标一致更新。"), "parents": Array [String("ef7656c5e7ea2ecc8a9936bc117f13cfb47068ef")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("1866da196"), "subject": String("chore: 封印 v0.1.37 发布候选")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("lingxi-dev"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1788959348), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("ef7656c5e7ea2ecc8a9936bc117f13cfb47068ef"), "message": String("chore(release): prepare v0.1.37 release metadata\n\nversion 0.1.36→0.1.37，releaseGeneration 14→15；release-digest v1 重写为\nv0.1.37 摘要（7 项：MCP 生命周期、掉线可用性、媒体去重、内联视频、\n排队结算、引用角标、设置页手感）并 append 进 v2 滚动史册（18 条）；\nrelease:preflight PASS（历史最大 0.1.36/14）。"), "parents": Array [String("c9494ae9b6ec3806898562863d7f25c311d388ab")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("ef7656c5e"), "subject": String("chore(release): prepare v0.1.37 release metadata")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("lingxi-dev"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1788959050), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("c9494ae9b6ec3806898562863d7f25c311d388ab"), "message": String("feat: MCP 连接器生命周期四档与空闲停泊 + 媒体展示去重与受控预览 + 排队回执与会话身份加固\n\n- MCP 连接器四档生命周期（保活/懒保活/急着连/懒连接）+ 空闲停泊：新增 idle\n  运行态与按需重启语义（休眠≠停机），工具调用全程忙碌计数防误停；设置页\n  新增生命周期与空闲断开配置（五语言文案），mcp-config 导入携带新字段；\n  eligibility 引入 startableOnDemand，临时掉线不再误判撤销——revocation/\n  parity/runtime 三处测试契约同步到新模型（revocation 原锁旧语义，本轮补齐）；\n  桥接 mcp_call 保留媒体任务占位（block-extractors 与直接调用一致）\n- 媒体展示：同一文件的自动交付与手动展示合并为一处（多图任务逐张保留、\n  完成通知重放不重复；content-semantics 新增 isSameFilePresentation +\n  coalesceMediaFilePresentations，chat-slice 逐张追加并同轮合并迟到完成）；\n  聊天内图片/视频预览优先走受控资源地址（preferLocalFile=false），视频改\n  内联 controls 播放、点击不再另开查看器；查看器与下载链路透传 resource\n- 排队发送：上一条投递未核实前「立即插入」阻塞并提示（queuedDeliveryUnverified，\n  五语言）；composer-send-coordinator 改为终态+接收双证据结算，迟到旧回执\n  不得结算新回合，run 冲突只能经权威历史核实\n- 会话身份：桌面输入历史关联改为业务会话 ID 与 SDK 文件头 UUID 独立校验\n  （manifest/文件/运行实例多重绑定、证据读取期复检、提交期间绑定失效不签发\n  接受回执）；message-utils 证据链新增 branch_head_changed/runtime_identity_mismatch\n- 知识引用：角标改内联样式并清洗包附括号与字段名包装（只洗展示层不洗原文）；\n  citationMarkdown 提示词与三工具 citationNotice 收紧（禁止输出字段名/XML 包装）\n- 设置页交互：Escape 只关当前菜单并还焦点（SelectWidget/AnchoredPortal/\n  useAnchoredDropdown/ModelEditPanel/ModelWidget）；Toast 卡片化+aria+6s 错误\n  时长；电脑控制刷新、模型测试、拉取模型、搜索验证四处补忙碌态与防重入/中止\n- MCP runtimeContext 补齐 agentId（执行前复核与凭据同身份）；持久化指纹\n  按 compatible 分类 repin（mcp-config 契约描述纳入 lifecycle 默认值）"), "parents": Array [String("c1a7906182d3675b664c6c1ee1a59bcaa0463eec")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("c9494ae9b"), "subject": String("feat: MCP 连接器生命周期四档与空闲停泊 + 媒体展示去重与受控预览 + 排队回执与会话身份加固")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("lingxi-dev"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1788936637), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("c1a7906182d3675b664c6c1ee1a59bcaa0463eec"), "message": String("fix: 封印提交误纳自嵌套再生补丁，恢复候选版本\n\nR10-09 在封印前验证时于工作区就地再生补丁，把当时未提交的审计文件\n改动卷入补丁并随 seal 提交入库，触发 post-verification diff guard。\n补丁恢复为候选 5fbd96e0 的提交版本（该文件内容对 R10-09 无断言约束，\n每次运行就地再生）。遗留：round2/DELIVERY_MANIFEST.sha256 中该补丁\n条目暂指再生版哈希，随下一次候选提交一并刷新（该文件不在审计白名单，\n本提交不可触碰）。"), "parents": Array [String("03cb7f9c23ef26e285e18d7c1e300877d7b924b2")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("c1a790618"), "subject": String("fix: 封印提交误纳自嵌套再生补丁，恢复候选版本")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("lingxi-dev"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1788936518), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("03cb7f9c23ef26e285e18d7c1e300877d7b924b2"), "message": String("chore: 封印 CI 流水线与分支保护简化候选\n\nVERIFIED_SOURCE_SHA 推进至简化候选 5fbd96e0。全量 13443/0、\ntypecheck×3 + lint 绿；round2/round3 交付清单同步再生。六处坐标一致更新。"), "parents": Array [String("5fbd96e0a287e5b88fa9ce6ba32b0fe6a332f40e")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("03cb7f9c2"), "subject": String("chore: 封印 CI 流水线与分支保护简化候选")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("lingxi-dev"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1788936408), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("5fbd96e0a287e5b88fa9ce6ba32b0fe6a332f40e"), "message": String("chore: 简化 CI 流水线与分支保护（双必过检查+去重复门禁）\n\nCI 只在 PR 触发（合并进 main 后不再重复跑全量）；lint-open-boundary\n独立岗哨与发布矩阵源级知识烟测退场（npm test/CI 矩阵单点覆盖）；\n发布链 quality-gate（typecheck/lint/npm test 二次考试）与 release job\n重复 digest 校验、CI 过期注释同步清理；知识库发布期性能门保留。\n\nGitHub 分支保护必过检查收敛为 macos-15 arm64 + windows-2025 x64 两腿，\n解除 strict（必须最新）、enforce_admins、会话清零与强制 PR 流程，\n允许直推 main 热修。守卫契约测试随新形状更新并钉住防回流。\n\n验证：全量 13443 passed / 0 failed（s35-ci-simplify-full-v3 + j62 同树）；\ntypecheck×3 + eslint 0 error；round2/round3 交付清单同步再生（补丁+记录）。"), "parents": Array [String("6f5abd6db1bf6c03792b7abd2165b22033d8408d")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("5fbd96e0a"), "subject": String("chore: 简化 CI 流水线与分支保护（双必过检查+去重复门禁）")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("Lane"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1788932734), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("6f5abd6db1bf6c03792b7abd2165b22033d8408d"), "message": String("Merge pull request #52 from ItsDalk-Lane/fix/packaged-smoke-candidates\n\nfix: 打包知识检索冒烟断言对齐现行证据形状"), "parents": Array [String("2d03714fbfce562b8a1e7de7b0538d14c78c7647"), String("604a293005f371f5e715c0c040081a31eab5479e")], "refs": Array [Object {"kind": String("tag"), "name": String("v0.1.36")}, Object {"kind": String("tag"), "name": String("train-stable-15")}], "shortHash": String("6f5abd6db"), "subject": String("Merge pull request #52 from ItsDalk-Lane/fix/packaged-smoke-candidates")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("lingxi-dev"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1788931500), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("604a293005f371f5e715c0c040081a31eab5479e"), "message": String("chore: 封印打包知识冒烟断言修复候选\n\nVERIFIED_SOURCE_SHA 推进至断言修复候选。全量 13442/0、证据 25/25。\n六处坐标一致更新。"), "parents": Array [String("311c3fa8f9b05ea996d51ca77a16c9b87b8c4c44")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("604a29300"), "subject": String("chore: 封印打包知识冒烟断言修复候选")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("lingxi-dev"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1788931499), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("311c3fa8f9b05ea996d51ca77a16c9b87b8c4c44"), "message": String("fix: 打包知识检索冒烟断言对齐现行证据形状\n\nPR #51 改写的归档检索冒烟断言 evidence.entries，但\nsearchWithEvidence 的证据容器字段是 candidates（NotebookRetrievalChunk\n带 sourceId）——第四次 tag 构建在包内检索烟测崩溃\n（Cannot read properties of undefined）。修正后本地 smoke 4 项绿。\n\n验证：全量 13442 passed / 0 failed（j59，引导 j60 后证据 25/25）；\nround2 交付清单同步再生补丁与记录（217/217）。"), "parents": Array [String("2d03714fbfce562b8a1e7de7b0538d14c78c7647")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("311c3fa8f"), "subject": String("fix: 打包知识检索冒烟断言对齐现行证据形状")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("Lane"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1788930418), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("2d03714fbfce562b8a1e7de7b0538d14c78c7647"), "message": String("Merge pull request #51 from ItsDalk-Lane/fix/remove-dead-knowledge-benchmarks\n\nfix: 打包知识检索冒烟改用现行 API + intel 向量测试预算"), "parents": Array [String("3028ee39602d22b2bc4e8d7627ccae4d3a03ad38"), String("9c4bbcef11b1c5d48c3a75899138107fd69e29af")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("2d03714fb"), "subject": String("Merge pull request #51 from ItsDalk-Lane/fix/remove-dead-knowledge-benchmarks")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("lingxi-dev"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1788923706), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("9c4bbcef11b1c5d48c3a75899138107fd69e29af"), "message": String("chore: 封印发布流水线收口 III 候选\n\nVERIFIED_SOURCE_SHA 推进至收口 III 候选。全量 13442/0、证据 25/25。\n六处坐标一致更新。"), "parents": Array [String("6f08572182259651f1c511829fc866ee65c7cb40")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("9c4bbcef1"), "subject": String("chore: 封印发布流水线收口 III 候选")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("lingxi-dev"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1788923705), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("6f08572182259651f1c511829fc866ee65c7cb40"), "message": String("test: 向量关闭外层预算提到 300s\n\nintel 共享运行器劣化时整体慢 3–4 倍，120s 外层预算仍被环境开销\n（Node 启动/原生模块加载）吃满。子进程内 45s 墙钟自限不变（实际\n工作不受影响），外层只补环境余量：120s→300s。本地 30 轮 517ms。\n全量 13442/0（j57）。"), "parents": Array [String("12c8a336000ba073af98d76449f32a7574184591")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("6f0857218"), "subject": String("test: 向量关闭外层预算提到 300s")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("lingxi-dev"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1788915890), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("12c8a336000ba073af98d76449f32a7574184591"), "message": String("Merge branch 'fix/remove-dead-knowledge-benchmarks' of https://github.com/ItsDalk-Lane/LingxiAgent into fix/remove-dead-knowledge-benchmarks"), "parents": Array [String("51ea2084685473ea6a70540a30bc84c4dc1cf7cd"), String("1108f083176aeecaa46aa39b0279ad2af2d08b22")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("12c8a3360"), "subject": String("Merge branch 'fix/remove-dead-knowledge-benchmarks' of https://github.com/ItsDalk-Lane/LingxiAgent into fix/remove-dead-knowledge-benchmarks")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("lingxi-dev"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1788915879), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("51ea2084685473ea6a70540a30bc84c4dc1cf7cd"), "message": String("chore: 封印发布流水线收口 II 候选\n\nVERIFIED_SOURCE_SHA 推进至收口 II 候选。全量 13442/0、证据 25/25。\n六处坐标一致更新。"), "parents": Array [String("a5d53265f659866014bef0188bde8fc97f161030")], "refs": Array [], "shortHash": String("51ea20846"), "subject": String("chore: 封印发布流水线收口 II 候选")}, Object {"additions": Number(0), "authorName": String("lingxi-dev"), "changedFiles": Number(0), "committedAt": Number(1788915878), "deletions": Number(0), "hash": String("a5d53265f659866014bef0188bde8fc97f161030"), "message": String("test: 向量关闭测试按墙钟自限（45s 内最多 30 轮，最少 8 轮）\n\nintel 满载运行器今日多次吃满 30s/120s 预算（本轮 import 1371s，\n运行器整体劣化三倍）。本测试的目的是「建图期间反复关闭不崩溃且\n向量原值保留」——轮数是压力强度不是契约；子进程内 45s 墙钟自限、\n保底 8 轮真实关闭压力，断言与输出随之参数化。本地 30 轮 517ms。\n全量 13442/0（j55）。"), "pa